OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 20s dies in two-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died following a
OL,7,Ftwo-vehicle crash in Wiltshire.
OL,9,FWiltshire Police said a Mercedes Benz
OL,10,FCLA was travelling westbound on Double
OL,11,FHedges towards Durrington, and a
OL,12,FVolkswagen T Cross was travelling in
OL,13,Fthe opposite direction towards Bulford
OL,14,Fwhen the collision happened.
OL,16,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,17,FA3028 at 20:45 BST on Wednesday, but
OL,18,Fthe driver of the Mercedes was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene. Police
OL,20,Fsaid his family had been informed.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
